      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FORTY LOVE (10) led at his most recent outing and scored at Horsham over 1700m, getting home by 8 metres. That followed an encouraging minor placing at Melton the start prior. Meets a similar line up so he can add to the strong recent effort. SOUTH SEAS ROCK NZ (8) settled well back last start and saluted by 1.2 metres, in a far better performance at Menangle over 1609m. Shouldn't spend a penny from this draw and the sprint lane may come in handy. This should be an easier assignment so he is set to continue his resurgent form. ATA RANGI (5) is worth another chance after a last-start tenth over 2570m at Geelong two weeks ago. ROCKIN GEMMA (6) has been hard to fault of late, adding to the winning tally last start with success over 1609m at Port Pirie.",
